ntdll: Add support for hiding wine version information from applications.

wine-staging's ntdll-Hide_Wine_Exports (Sebastian Lackner, 2015, Wine bug 38656), rebased
onto the CrossOver 26.3 tree: build_ntdll_module() no longer returns the module, so the
hidden_exports_init() call moves to its end. With HKCU\Software\Wine HideWineExports=Y (or
per exe under AppDefaults\<app>.exe), LdrGetProcedureAddress reports wine_get_version,
wine_get_build_id and wine_get_host_version as missing.

The Witcher 3 5.0 probes GetProcAddress(ntdll, "wine_get_version") and, when it succeeds,
never initialises NVIDIA Streamline (no DLSS, Reflex or DLSS-G); the run script sets the
value in that game's prefix.

